From 49865161aa46125bbfc9b4a7e5a6df1df5e7f2b3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 18:37:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 08/17] Couch Party: use the stock character screen with up to
 8 cursors

The overlay lobby is replaced by the original character select. Player 1
starts with a cursor; every other controller presses A to join and gets
its own cursor (1P-4P as stock, 5P-8P drawn as coloured frames). Picking,
un-picking and OK work as in the original; B before picking lets a joined
player leave. At least 2 players are needed to move on. Each player keeps
the controller they joined with through the course select and races.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qq7B1uqfWVWykYRDDMiuXa
